    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like staying is just forced misery. like i'm forced to watch the wreckage until there's nothing left to even look at. if the struggle is just futile, why am i even still a witness to it? isn't there a dignity in just... exiting before the rot gets into everything?",
